{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-sci":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-sci/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-van-der-waals-hopf-channel","@type":["folio-assistant-sci:Definition","doco:Section"],"label":"def:van-der-waals-hopf-channel","kind":"definition","title":"The Hopf symmetric block $e_+$ — retained cosh carrier (not van der Waals)","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-hopf-diquark","papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-trm-hopf-sigma1-sq-closed-form"],"tags":["van-der-waals","dispersion","hopf-link","wedderburn-block","idempotent","intermolecular","vol-zero"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.VanDerWaals.vdwSymmetricBlock","text":"van-der-waals-hopf-channel.md","leanSource":"van-der-waals-hopf-channel.lean","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"def:van-der-waals-hopf-channel\"></a><p>In the 2-strand inter-molecular Hecke algebra <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">H_2(q)</code>, the <strong>symmetric (Hopf) block</strong> is the idempotent</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-math math-display\">  e_+ = \\frac{\\sigma + q^{-1}}{q + q^{-1}}, \\qquad \\sigma \\mapsto q \\ \\ (\\text{trivial rep}),</code></pre>\n<p>the Hopf <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">/[2]_q</code> block. Its complement is the <strong>directional (hydrogen-bond) block</strong> <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">e_- = (q-\\sigma)/(q+q^{-1})</code> (sign rep, <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\sigma\\mapsto -q^{-1}</code>).</p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/information-theory/van-der-waals-hopf-channel.md","heading":"Definition","number":"22.10.6","page":"b/def-van-der-waals-hopf-channel","qa":{"counts":{"pass":81,"fail":1,"warn":0,"na":10,"unknown":0,"stale":66},"milnor":{"total":3,"notPassing":0}},"lean":{"expected":true,"ref":"qou:QOU.VanDerWaals.vdwSymmetricBlock","via":"sibling","path":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/information-theory/van-der-waals-hopf-channel.lean","compiles":"unchecked","sorry":false,"sorryBasis":"text"}}
